# Pairs with ReplicatedNotReAudited. A replicated revision of a protected
# record is audited as if a local principal had made it.
MODULE: AuditReAuditOnReplicationApply
TARGET: ReplicatedNotReAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: applying a replicated revision writes an audit record
PERTURBS: ReplicateApply

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<op, pending, finals, viewComplete>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the replication apply path emits an audit record.
    /\ finals' = finals \cup {Row(RemoteOp, "Committed", "admin", "replication", FALSE, FALSE)}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<op, pending, viewComplete>>
--- END
